1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Samoa, rise and hoist your flag, this is your crown!

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Samoa, rise and hoist your flag, this is your crown!

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Look at those stars where I wave:

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
This is the symbol of Jesus, who died for Samoa.

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Oh, Samoa, hold on to your rule forever.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Do not be afraid;
God is our foundation, our freedom.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Samoa, arise: your banner is waved, your crown!